1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,399
I bought a time machine for five dollars.

2
00:00:02,739 --> 00:00:04,297
Worst decision of my life!

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,643
Ten seconds later, I was standing in 1912!

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,440
I looked at the enormous ship.

5
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:15,465
Wait...

6
00:00:15,805 --> 00:00:16,703
TITANIC?!

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,716
Everyone was excited.

8
00:00:22,056 --> 00:00:23,013
Except me.

9
00:00:23,353 --> 00:00:25,468
Because I already knew what was going to happen!

10
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:29,633
Could I change history?

11
00:00:29,973 --> 00:00:32,190
Watch the full adventure on History World!
